  "details": "With the release of VRChat on mobile, it gives VRChat users a whole new way of playing, so it now makes a total of four different controller types.\n\n- VR\n\n- Keyboard/Mouse\n\n- Controller\n\n- Touch control\n\nCertain worlds (mostly games) require certain controls which are not available with certain control types.\n\nFor example, certain games can only be played with VR controls, while some other games currently cannot be played with touch controls, as mobile is still new.\n\nI personally think that having a way for World Makers to display what controllers are supported directly from the menus would help users to see if they can play in these certain worlds.\n\nIt would also be useful to filter out the worlds in which the control type the user is currently using is not compatible.",
